flowchart TD
    A[Person submits setup] --> B{Does any family member exist?}
    B -- yes --> E409[409 CONFLICT_FAMILY_EXISTS, nothing created]
    B -- no --> C{Are all input rules met?<br/>username, display name, password, parent confirmation}
    C -- no --> E400[400 VALIDATION_FAILED, every broken rule listed]
    C -- yes --> D[Create active parent with hashed password]
    D --> F{Did another setup commit first?}
    F -- yes --> E409
    F -- no --> G[Start session for the parent]
    G --> H[201 with session token and member]
